PHASE 1 — Enable Required GCP Services

Run once in Cloud Shell:

gcloud config set project testadi-459816


Enable APIs:

gcloud services enable \
  aiplatform.googleapis.com \
  generativelanguage.googleapis.com \
  run.googleapis.com \
  artifactregistry.googleapis.com \
  cloudbuild.googleapis.com \
  iam.googleapis.com


Verify:

gcloud services list --enabled | grep -E "aiplatform|run|artifact|build"

