 PHASE 3 — Verify Vertex AI Model Access (CRITICAL)

Important concept
gcloud ai models list will show 0 models for Gemini — this is NORMAL.

Gemini models are publisher models, not project models.

 Correct way to verify access (Cloud Shell Python)
python3


Inside Python REPL:

