Expected output:

Hi there! How can I help you today?


 If this works → Vertex AI access is CONFIRMED

 PHASE 4 — Create ADK Project Folder

From Cloud Shell:

mkdir adk
cd adk


Your conceptual structure (no code explanation here):

adk/
 ├── agent/               # agent logic (ADK style)
 ├── tools/               # tools for agent
 ├── system_prompt.txt    # system instructions
 ├── server.py            # API entry (Cloud Run)
