 PHASE 5 — Build Container Image (Cloud Build)

Create Artifact Registry repo (once):

gcloud artifacts repositories create agents \
  --repository-format=docker \
  --location=us-central1 \
  --description="Agent images"


Build image:

gcloud builds submit \
  --tag us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/testadi-459816/agents/adk-agent:latest


Verify image:

gcloud artifacts docker images list us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/testadi-459816/agents

 PHASE 6 — Deploy ADK Agent to Cloud Run
gcloud run deploy adk-agent \
  --image us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/testadi-459816/agents/adk-agent:latest \
  --region us-central1 \
  --allow-unauthenticated \
  --service-account agent-sa@testadi-459816.iam.gserviceaccount.com \
  --port 8080


